{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5ec1dc3e477e4bd9d78399f2aa4dea007d3ff63d489a84a009f4ff954223586b", "ja": "バンドの練習中、社長からプロデューサーに\n電話が。なんと、初ライブのブッキングが決\nまったとの事。怖気づく一同だが、可奈がや\nりたいと言い出し、恵美と亜利沙も同意。練\n習を頑張ろうと、気合いを入れるのだった。", "zh": "乐队练习期间，社长打电话给制作人。\n据说，初次演出的演出安排竟然已经\n定下来了。众人都不免有些胆怯，但可奈说\n自己想参加，惠美和亚利沙也表示赞同。\n大家为努力练习而鼓足了干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b4dcc9ac384ee97ede93a6cc4c36f33ffc9478bc5aef6b23a15208dce6614f0", "ja": "（恵美達のバンド練習を見ていたら、高木社長から\n電話があった。その内容というのが……）", "zh": "（我正在看惠美她们练习乐队，高木社长打来了电话。至于电话里说的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "7dba2acb639b1787b0e59694d3a6098c1591b65979fd3765403408c5d9035955", "ja": "ええ～っ！？", "zh": "咦咦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a59c79716cde072afaefc740bdcf0745b1cf0fe5da780fabbc7768e4f5077f6", "ja": "私たちのバンドの……", "zh": "我们乐队的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5c0a26d6fbdc69c893e21fbe7bd7a474545d3a3aec62c44774fc8c7c25084d1", "ja": "初ライブですかぁ！？", "zh": "首次演出吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "7fc3cef9590b9ba793054cc1b79e7c24a011c0e92abdd4e4348d0a11c2208fd4", "ja": "でもでも！　ライブって、50％の速度で\n曲を通せるようになったばっかりなのに……？", "zh": "可是可是！明明才刚刚能以50％的速度把整首歌唱完……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "3c763a16ed2fd852c624a73e72116c4199300846128396238b638b9ce28381d4", "ja": "初ライブとか、もちろんいつかはやりたいですケド。\nもうちょっと後の話だと思ってました……。", "zh": "初次公演什么的，当然总有一天想做啦。不过，我原以为那是再晚一点的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "737c76388b6860bb556417bd6e2ca6ec4765d320c032642b2b35b2564de8e10c", "ja": "すまない。今回の件、社長がものすごく乗り気なんだ。\nアイドル達のバンドを楽しみにしているみたいで……。", "zh": "抱歉。这次的事，社长特别积极。好像很期待偶像们组建的乐队……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "8bc2b8948f8821a782c35609169791336e6942ee661c716419359c9cba0f514d", "ja": "そっか～。社長もアタシたちみたいに、\nバンド仲間ができてうれしいのかもしれないね。", "zh": "这样啊～。社长可能也和我们一样，因为有了乐队伙伴而感到开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "22fd65190db9ccc7818bc5cfd7bcf6819028a3fad0aa39be7646b3c177d1e643", "ja": "バンド仲間ができて、うれしい……？", "zh": "有了乐队伙伴，就这么开心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1840c16566ddb653c869d0fd662a48e52bf9fc2d4b6454bc67473247d990bd5a", "ja": "3人のバンドは、まだ始まったばかりだ。着実に\n成長をしているからこそ、ペースを乱したくない。", "zh": "你们3个人的乐队才刚刚起步。正因为一直都在稳步\n成长，所以才不想打乱节奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ca77423e8538be99c16581d6094873b4647b41b45f4b8f9c052525fb990d5b52", "ja": "初ライブを急ぐことで負担がかかるなら、\n今回の話は断ってもいいと思う。みんなはどうだ？", "zh": "如果急着举办首次演出会增加负担，我觉得也可以拒绝这次的提议。大家觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "99e414791b1e6c4d835efffa2b0f58d59ff4ea68dcb531107e6021c553f05b84", "ja": "うーん……そうだね。アタシたちに、\n期待してくれるのはうれしいけど……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。能得到期待，我们是很高兴啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "cd89776b6fddaaf905fcf22ef6ed838b75e7a591a1716b52c7854fa6f97dba36", "ja": "ありさたちじゃ、技術的に不安がありますよね。\nやっぱり、今回は……。", "zh": "光靠亚利沙她们，技术上还是会让人不放心吧。\n这次果然还是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "3eb4d370b09e919dc8ad7aeb36062d7c16ba699c815247c0ab6bf83ed5897e44", "ja": "あ、あの！　恵美さん、亜利沙さん、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊、那个！惠美、亚利沙，还有{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e0c8f0c92087dc90a87f318048ff97633e1ece674ca5f303fca39cbedaf3e2e6", "ja": "どうした、可奈？", "zh": "怎么了，可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "247bcaf1a376cadbaa4792be0e22bfd5dd0729fa17a6523686ffdad0898d3106", "ja": "私……ライブやってみても、いいかもですっ！", "zh": "我觉得……自己试着开场演唱会，或许也不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "bc57ee97ad7b7987bad1b6bad3f891ef840d7daecf9cb4523ebf5196b49aa9ff", "ja": "えええっ！！？　か、可奈ちゃんっ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶！！？可、可奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "46a58eb62c2f77102bb3bc15a27eb5a34132eba514eb2078f7ad8a0ec39f6e51", "ja": "可奈？　どうしたの、急に……。", "zh": "可奈？怎么了，突然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "e80ac59652fa2adbd02700762d821254d84b0c3064ba02421f4e31b1dee29ef1", "ja": "私、ギターは、ひとりで歌う時にあったら便利かも～？\nって思って、始めただけだったんです。", "zh": "我当初只是觉得，弹吉他的话，自己一个人唱歌的时候可能会方便一些～？\n就是这么想着，才开始学的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a39b2261edeb2ec08760cc9d1cc68eed17f2383b387677b2afdaf370af9651cc", "ja": "だからこんなふうに、みんなと一緒に\nバンドで弾くことになるなんて思ってなくて。", "zh": "所以我原本没想过，自己会像这样和大家一起在乐队里演奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "49dc34229911a03858d802249dd85fc7895e5d80c7e9b1dbd5960896905223ad", "ja": "でも、バンドが始まったら……みんなと演奏するの、\n想像の100倍くらい楽しかったんです！", "zh": "不过，乐队真正开始演奏之后……和大家一起演奏，比我想象中还要开心100倍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "350849e8f54eb10a4cf57726defbb371cf619763a0d18dda4b9d1ceeef823de9", "ja": "だから「バンド仲間ができてうれしい」って、\nすっごくわかる気がして……。", "zh": "所以，我特别能理解那种“交到了乐队伙伴，真开心”的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "2df5d63d7ae1f28c7b3a1f66fa89dcce3444d1740c01d7bef78f4d06e3aff42e", "ja": "そしたら「みんなとライブに出たい」って気持ちが、\n口からぽーんって……ううっ、すみません～。", "zh": "于是，“想和大家一起登台演出”的心情，就不由自主地脱口而出了……呜呜，对不起～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3b05df195254a5148d548f5f9faccbf06226d3a6a4539b0f17ffabfbabf73f41", "ja": "社長がブッキングしたのは、ごく普通の\nライブハウス出演……アマチュアバンドとの対バンだ。", "zh": "社长订的场子，是个普普通通的\n小型演出场地……和业余乐队同台演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d73c470f54aec63e8f814989ffe7296b87d040d9ee48fbe2d7a3cfcc3b60e04c", "ja": "アイドルを見に来るお客さんだけじゃないだろうし、\n何かと厳しいかもしれない。それでも、挑戦するか？", "zh": "来看偶像的客人应该不止这些，可能会遇到各种严峻的情况。即便如此，你还要挑战吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "8cb77942fcdc7a95f0d34102350d1402b1f65d4a41640e77297821ddc7e3ec9a", "ja": "そこまで言われちゃったら、しょうがないな～。\nね、亜利沙？", "zh": "都说到这个份上了，那也没办法啦～。\n对吧，亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5221bae960de3b4e907f3a643ff3216ea0d19789da6e2a91380d602972804cb", "ja": "は、はい！　ありさ、DJとしての腕は\nまだまだですが……食らいついていきますっ！", "zh": "是、是的！虽然亜利沙作为DJ的本事还远远不够……但我会努力跟上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "b17891bd89e46fc02fb822e6cfa444f1b041f4d4ce882201da32bf6f8a37c0dc", "ja": "恵美さん、亜利沙さん！", "zh": "惠美小姐、亚利沙小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "394ad2162853a5772a2c9d9f3eea3be74de3ad75d13888445ca6b163614bdb45", "ja": "3人にやる気があるなら、\n俺からとやかく言う必要はないな！", "zh": "既然你们3个人都有干劲，\n那我就没必要多说什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "dcbbcd7dd2a7898aad1ce8506b107d134533052c09707f78da09c3196da4b376", "ja": "ライブ当日まで、もうあまり日がない。\n今はとにかく、練習を頑張ろう！", "zh": "离演出当天已经没多少时间了。\n现在总之先努力练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "d2f6aa1308947b4d97cf437e70c1da72cc999c0ff66ec8cd91cd40bd3e1189e0", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か。\n可奈、そろそろ帰らなくて大丈夫か？", "zh": "哎呀，已经这么晚了吗？\n可奈，差不多该回去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d5ff0ef1b974045b5af89104b4bc14d068d35c4b3357e9745499ab1b6ab801c", "ja": "わっ、本当だ～！？\n後片付けがまだなのに～！", "zh": "哇，真的耶～！？\n明明都还没收拾好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "52e50e0ef6f37441c946aa43ac5948115353f540f2dba2eb02b6a7b7b05759cf", "ja": "それくらい、アタシらでやっておくって。\nお疲れさま、可奈！", "zh": "这种程度的事，我们来收拾就好啦。\n辛苦了，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "3cd13b38d946da120132c2bcf5eb1bcd62c7b705e792df6452e87b3214652820", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、また明日です！", "zh": "可奈，明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "50518ca57a98b3d4951b326dbfc34d7dc9b7a72691d2df40aa5492108657cb92", "ja": "ありがとうございます、恵美さん、亜利沙さん！\n{$P$}さんも、また明日！", "zh": "谢谢你们，惠美小姐、亚利沙小姐！\n{$P$}先生也明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ece50fccb0ccce78790ec21bc2357caaefd31a90777ecec12cdbb4aab079c036", "ja": "可奈、気をつけて！\n慌てて走ったりして、転ばないようにな！", "zh": "可奈，小心点！\n别慌慌张张地跑，注意别摔倒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1041_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "4c51617f4f5e393c4a95f6ae395f62566a81e6c35696fcafae4a57f7d1fb3de2", "ja": "なんか、可奈がいるとにぎやかでいいよね！\nそれに今日は、なんか、助かっちゃったかも。", "zh": "有可奈在总觉得很热闹，真好呢！\n而且今天好像还帮了大忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "daaa021a5c2d0de49279377d11a0ef5f0c0a8c331cada57ed660e6b6abbe09ea", "ja": "もしかして……可奈ちゃんが\n「ライブに出たい」って言ってくれたことですか？", "zh": "难道是……可奈说想参加演唱会这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "0b2b6247b571f715daa90a9c9839a10773bcf1ad421fb325c2a8a365245fb96e", "ja": "うん。アタシなんて、初心者だしって、\n気後れしちゃってたけど……。", "zh": "嗯。我之前还觉得自己只是个新手，\n心里直打退堂鼓呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "a9b82bb1d13c906c18e16b1e4f6af786dadca1c309ef1f6830a05052430f642a", "ja": "でもあんなふうにまっすぐに「一緒にやりたい」って\n言われたらさ……うれしくなっちゃうよね。", "zh": "可是，被那样直截了当地说“想和我一起做”……任谁都会开心起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "cfb1a7d765aca5f0d4f1b8a9cacec76e280bb09089c6930d36a7b2bbc8a109fd", "ja": "ありさも、うれしかったです！　ライブに備えて、\n最高のトラックを作らねば……！", "zh": "亚利沙也很开心！为了备战演出，\n必须制作出最棒的音轨才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1047_020meg", "source_sha256": "371fdab20a005272d37324363f829b5634aefb292b3e72ce4068bd9c4b55d4ee", "ja": "うん。期待してるよ、亜利沙！\n一緒にがんばって、すごいライブにしようね！", "zh": "嗯，我很期待哦，亚利沙！\n一起加油，办一场精彩的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "8aafbca81053c448a12547f3c1b8165b8aec3c0c4f1d2ef63fb4c3b345e645c6", "ja": "（3人の気持ちが、いい形で影響しあっている。これが\n人と一緒に音楽をやる、醍醐味なのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（3人的心情正以很好的方式互相影响着。和大家一起演奏音乐，或许这就是其中的乐趣所在吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
